{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54514","headline":"兵要望江南 占云第三（京本作「占云第二十四○二十六首」） 一 · 易静","name":"兵要望江南 占云第三（京本作「占云第二十四○二十六首」） 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"兵若进，先（辛本、京本作「须」）要（京本作「是」）识浮云。\n云气顺时（京本作「随」）当急（京本作「速」）战，毋（京本作「勿」）令云散後交兵，莫问昼阴晴。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"易静","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54514.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54514","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}